      "principle": "Delay in lodging FIR cannot be a ground to doubt the claimant's case.",
      "held": "It is well settled that delay in lodging the FIR cannot be a ground to doubt the claimant's case. Knowing the Indian conditions as they are, we cannot expect a common man to first rush to the police station immediately after an accident.",
